// Delta II 7925 (1996).
// Nine GEM-40 strap-ons round an RS-27A Thor core: six light on the pad and drop at
// burnout as the other three light in the air. Then the Delta-K, the PAM-D and Mars
// Pathfinder. Built from plain parts: the GEMs are the `gem_40_ground` and `gem_40_air`
// assemblies (mods/realism/assemblies/boosters.json5) placed on the core.
